SUMMARY:Native Plant Sale (Apex)
DESCRIPTION:Come out to NCWF South Wake Conservationists Chapter’s native plant sale! Invite your friends and neighbors to shop our selection of native herbaceous-plant species. It’s all happening at SWC’s annual native plant sale hosted at Simple Gifts Community Garden’s open house. Expand your pollinator garden while helping support the conservation work of our chapter. Our knowledgeable team will be on hand to assist with your plant selections. There will also be a table with fun pollinator educational activities for kids\, so bring the whole family! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/native-plant-sale-apex/
CATEGORIES:Featured
