SUMMARY:Rolesville Arbor Day
DESCRIPTION:Visit NCWF Neuse River Hawks Conservationists Chapter at Arbor Day at Mill Bridge Nature Park in Rolesville! Stop by our table and check out our hands-on activities\, nature displays\, and listen to short talks about native plants and wildlife. We’ll demonstrate planting with native plants and talk about native bees\, the importance of keystone plants\, gardening with native plants\, and mosquito dunks. The Town of Rolesville will kick off the evening with a community tree planting and end the night with a screening of The Lorax. Join us for an evening in celebration of Arbor Day! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/rolesville-arbor-day/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
